<title>USA: Wyoming, Mich., $3.3 mln sale postponed - adviser.</title>
<headline>Wyoming, Mich., $3.3 mln sale postponed - adviser.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wyoming, Mich., has postponed its $3.3 million 1997 Michigan Transportation Bond Fund sale, Stauder Barch &amp; Associates Ins., the issuer's financial adviser, said Tuesday.</p>
<p>No new sales date has been set.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
